# acyclovir.msf
# pKa=9.25 (exocyclic NH2 → NH-, q=0→-1)
# Acyclic nucleoside antiviral. Guanine base with acyclic -CH2-O-CH2CH2OH chain.
# The physiologically relevant ionisation is the high-pKa N-H loss (pH 7.4 → anionic form ~0%).
# The low-pKa step (protonation at N1, pKa=2.27) was excluded because
# the protonated fused ring cannot be kekulized by RDKit at this tautomer.

